<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-845] Fix Image URL issue on documentation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-845</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently, on the doc pages of 0.6.0-SNAPSHOT, some images are not displayed properly because of the HTML tag &lt;tt&gt;&amp;lt;img src = &apos;/assets/...&apos; /&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The fix is easy, replace &lt;tt&gt;/assets/...&lt;/tt&gt; by &lt;tt&gt;../assets/...&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
