&lt;p&gt;    Currently, on the doc pages of 0.6.0-SNAPSHOT, some images are not displayed properly because of the HTML tag `&amp;lt;img src = &apos;/assets/...&apos; /&amp;gt;`&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    !&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;image&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/1532977/15153219/ab6bfd50-16d8-11e6-96b0-db59c1ef8699.png&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/1532977/15153219/ab6bfd50-16d8-11e6-96b0-db59c1ef8699.png&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    The fix is easy, replace `/assets/...` by `../assets/...``&lt;/p&gt;

